  "goodToKnow": "Der Haken is a hook: der Kleiderhaken. It's also the tick mark ✓ (einen Haken setzen), so abhaken means to tick off, or to put something behind you: Das Thema ist abgehakt. Die Sache hat einen Haken means there's a catch. In boxing, it's a hook punch. Einen Haken schlagen means to dodge sideways, like a hare. The plural is the same: die Haken."
